      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通（需同調）</em><br />這套護甲具有5發充能。穿着這套護甲期間，你可以用附贈動作消耗1發充能來用這套護甲，以自己爲目標施展以下法術之一：<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.1B8U6kl0egesx3FK]{跳躍術 Jump}</em>（1充能）或<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.GNvrHluGdgqD06wZ]{浮空術 Levitate}</em> （2充能）。<br />這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d4 + 1]]發已被消耗的充能數。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>由<span class=\"GramE\">互相鎖接的</span>金屬環組成，通常着裝於布衣或皮衣的夾層之間。這種護甲爲着裝者的上半身提供了適中的保護，<span class=\"GramE\">且鎖環間</span>相互碰撞的聲音也可以被外層衣服減弱。</p></div></div><p>This armor has 5 charges. While you wear it, you can use a bonus action to expend 1 or more charges to cast one of the following spells from the armor, targeting yourself: @spell[Jump] (1 charge) or @spell[Levitate] (2 charges).</p><p>This armor regains [[/r 1d4 + 1]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Made of interlocking metal rings, a chain shirt is worn between layers of clothing or leather. This armor offers modest protection to the wearer's upper body and allows the sound of the rings rubbing against one another to be muffled by outer layers.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
